Z||000000||spike||01-24-2001||07:59 PM||||Hi, this is my 85SEFB.  It is powered by the Duke, auto tranny.  I bought this car last summer as a project car.  I paid 2000cdn for it.  It has quite a few flaws but it is mostly cosmetic.  The engine and tranny seem fine.  102,000km.  I do plan on painting it this summer if all goes well.  Color of choice not yet decided, maybe Silver & Blue.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_21.jpg"> <BR>Thanks, Mike||||reg||7
