Z||000003||spike||01-25-2001||07:44 PM||||I really like Blue Fieros myself, but the paint is in pretty bad shape.  This is my second Blue Fiero that I have owned.  I think I will keep the bottom Blue and do the top Silver (just above the molding).  The Wheels are made by Simmons.  They are 16 inche (3 piece model).  I am not sure of the width but they are wide.  When I bought the car it had 255s on the rear.  I replaced them with 235s after the cops busted me (stuck out too far).  The only problem now is I must be real carefull not to scrub the curb. I have nicked them a few times and once pretty hard.  I will get new rims and keep these for the track if I ever make it there.  I think it will take I while to finish my LITTLE project, but thats ok I have about 50 years left in me.  I just cant believe that my soon to be wife, Chantale (June 2002) is letting me do this.<P>Thanks, Mike<P>PS: Your all invited to my weeding. Maybe you can all pitch in and buy me a V8 Archie Master Kit. lol......      ||||reg||10
